rds will  reward you with tier 5 cache the rewards  from these caches are as follows as you  can see here the tier 2 to 5 caches have  a 23 percent chance of dropping an  exotic and have a pretty decent chance  of dropping a bonus drop containing a  classified  tear three four and five catches have a  chance to drop another classified item  with tier five having a whopping 80%  chance I ever made that as horrible luck  with RNG so that percentage probably  still isn't high enough ohm but for the  rest of us it's not unusual to have a  single cash drop in exotic and -  classified pieces when you get to the  higher waves even with an unoptimized  build a solar flare should be able to  make it to wave twenty to twenty  five-plus on world tier one with the  team of randoms you should be able to  comfortably make it over wave for tea  this runner did a couple of days ago  with random players some of which were  actually geared to that world tier and  some who obviously hadn't played  resistance before and we still made it  to level 51 in fact we probably could  have gone for another ten or twenty  levels but unfortunately I needed to log  off I haven't really optimized a build  for resistance but I've been doing quite  well using the six piece reclaimer where  the turret is my second skill I'm  rocking the Health's as my primary and a  decent bolt-action sniper as my  secondary the healing station will  helpful constant healing particularly  through the contamination waves but will  also keep you well stocked with ammo for  the later waves it would certainly help  if you had a couple of tanky DPS builds  in the team to take care of the boss  waves a solid strategy with the team is  to hold up next to a turret putting most  of your credits into it but if for some  reason you need to leave the safety of  the turret like with the laptop waves  make sure at least a couple stay behind  to protect it if it gets destroyed  you'll lose all of the credits you've  put into it if y